WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:02.150
Open the gates!

00:02.150 --> 00:04.480
The king of Ozmargo has returned!

00:04.900 --> 00:07.150
Lord Set! It's an emergency!

00:07.150 --> 00:09.140
I understand.

00:09.140 --> 00:13.240
Open the gates and summon the guard at once.

00:13.500 --> 00:16.210
<i>Why has he come to me himself?</i>

00:16.210 --> 00:20.120
<i>Can he be aware of that 
creature's existence?</i>

00:16.450 --> 00:17.450
It's the human king!

00:17.450 --> 00:18.320
To the gates!

00:18.320 --> 00:20.110
Acting king's orders!

00:25.990 --> 00:27.390
Do you think it's started?

00:27.390 --> 00:28.180
Any moment now.

00:28.180 --> 00:29.890
Let's hurry up and grab that diary...

00:30.490 --> 00:31.540
Sariphi?

00:32.290 --> 00:33.000
Don't you feel it?

00:33.670 --> 00:35.210
There's something near here.

00:35.950 --> 00:38.800
<i>Almost like someone is calling out.</i>

00:38.800 --> 00:40.230
Hey... Wait up!

00:49.350 --> 00:51.590
Wh-What is this thing?

00:54.030 --> 00:59.030
The Archpriest and the Truth About the King

01:00.010 --> 01:01.210
An animal?

01:01.710 --> 01:02.730
It's badly hurt.

01:03.910 --> 01:06.460
Whoa, Sariphi! Don't just walk up to it!

01:07.330 --> 01:09.030
I've never seen a monster like that in...

01:09.520 --> 01:12.300
This person is no monster.

01:12.570 --> 01:13.610
"Person"?

01:14.370 --> 01:16.460
You don't mean this thing's a beast, do you?

01:16.790 --> 01:21.190
Hey, Bennu, could you cure 
their wounds for me?

01:21.190 --> 01:23.690
Oh, all right. I'll just—

01:24.060 --> 01:24.640
Huh?

01:25.130 --> 01:29.620
Sorry, girlie, but I can't 
help you with this guy.

01:31.570 --> 01:33.500
What'd the holy beast say?

01:33.500 --> 01:36.380
Bennu says that his healing won't work...

01:36.380 --> 01:39.140
because they're no longer alive.

01:39.650 --> 01:40.620
Huh?

01:40.990 --> 01:43.320
Human girl.

01:43.590 --> 01:46.530
Why do you possess the king's magic?

01:46.530 --> 01:49.580
Was that your voice just now?

01:49.580 --> 01:51.260
The king's magic?

01:55.140 --> 01:56.920
I see.

01:56.920 --> 02:00.130
His Majesty has chosen you, then.

02:00.780 --> 02:03.850
Who are you?

02:04.270 --> 02:06.690
Why're you talking to yourself, Sariphi?

02:07.680 --> 02:09.480
Can't you hear him, Lante?

02:09.480 --> 02:13.300
As you can see, uttering words is beyond me.

02:13.300 --> 02:17.110
I am speaking directly to your mind.

02:17.740 --> 02:21.320
I am the former archpriest, Capel.

02:21.320 --> 02:25.000
As a hideous, silent demon,

02:25.000 --> 02:29.210
I have guarded the king's secret for a century.

02:29.210 --> 02:30.890
The archpriest...

02:30.890 --> 02:33.400
Archpriest?! Hang on!

02:34.050 --> 02:37.080
That's the second most 
powerful guy in Ozmargo!

02:37.080 --> 02:41.960
He disappeared during the last king's reign, 
and they never replaced him.

02:41.960 --> 02:42.960
But then...

02:42.960 --> 02:46.420
How did someone like you 
end up in this form?

02:46.420 --> 02:51.600
I know a great secret 
concerning the king's birth.

02:51.600 --> 02:55.010
And so that I might never 
unwittingly reveal it,

02:55.010 --> 02:59.470
I ensorcelled myself and went into hiding.

02:59.470 --> 03:03.370
But then a judge named Set discovered me.

03:03.730 --> 03:06.630
Then Set gave you these wounds?! How awful!

03:06.630 --> 03:08.320
Wait a second. I'll help you.

03:08.320 --> 03:10.060
There is no more need.

03:11.540 --> 03:12.670
Give me your hand.

03:15.820 --> 03:21.390
To save the king, I shall entrust 
you with the secret of his birth,

03:21.390 --> 03:26.720
which I have guarded since 
His Late Majesty's reign.

03:28.360 --> 03:29.500
Forgive me!

03:31.890 --> 03:32.870
Are you hurt?!

03:32.870 --> 03:38.520
I must apologize. As I feared, 
my human form is no match for beasts.

03:38.520 --> 03:42.360
Leave the rest to me, sire. 
Take time to recuperate.

03:42.590 --> 03:43.310
No.

03:43.730 --> 03:46.550
Stopping Set's rampage is my duty.

03:47.060 --> 03:48.990
I'll fight my way to him!

03:48.990 --> 03:49.710
Yes, sire!

03:49.710 --> 03:51.780
No need for that.

03:52.490 --> 03:55.210
I'm amazed that you returned.

03:55.570 --> 04:00.920
But I will thank you to refrain 
from further violence in my palace,

04:00.920 --> 04:03.130
false king.

04:03.750 --> 04:05.190
Set!

04:05.190 --> 04:07.490
In His Late Majesty's time,

04:07.490 --> 04:13.970
the queen, who had always been sickly, 
quietly passed away.

04:13.970 --> 04:17.330
The late king's disappointment 
was immeasurable.

04:17.610 --> 04:23.650
Because at that time, the royal 
couple had yet to produce an heir.

04:24.270 --> 04:25.960
Archpriest Capel.

04:26.320 --> 04:29.450
Keep this matter private for the time being.

04:29.450 --> 04:32.870
Only you and I know of it.

04:32.870 --> 04:34.660
Meaning, sire?

04:34.960 --> 04:39.510
Find him with all haste, 
and bring him back to this realm.

04:39.510 --> 04:42.730
He is the only one with whom I share blood.

04:42.730 --> 04:48.260
You mean to turn to His Highness, 
your exiled younger brother, for an heir?!

04:48.650 --> 04:50.690
The last king had a brother?

04:50.690 --> 04:51.970
And he was exiled?

04:52.240 --> 04:56.040
When twin boys are born 
into the royal house,

04:56.040 --> 05:01.100
only the more promising is raised—
a custom known as the "lion's drop."

05:01.100 --> 05:05.640
The younger brother was driven 
from the palace soon after birth.

05:05.640 --> 05:10.710
And again, only the late king 
and I are aware of that fact.

05:11.060 --> 05:18.250
I soon tracked him down and 
made a startling discovery.

05:18.610 --> 05:23.450
In the midst of a recent battle with humans,

05:23.450 --> 05:28.750
His Highness had secretly fled 
to Yoana and sired a child there.

05:29.170 --> 05:31.630
Then... that child is...

05:31.630 --> 05:32.470
Yes.

05:32.470 --> 05:35.840
The current king of Ozmargo.

05:36.320 --> 05:39.550
The late king's brother 
had already passed away.

05:39.550 --> 05:44.270
With no other choice, I took the babe 
from its mother before it opened its eyes,

05:44.270 --> 05:46.020
and I returned to this realm.

05:46.470 --> 05:51.430
The child was revealed alongside 
news of the queen's death,

05:51.430 --> 05:57.080
and the people greeted him as the son 
she had given her life to birth.

05:57.410 --> 06:05.290
But the late king was never able to accept 
that his heir was a human's son.

06:05.290 --> 06:10.080
Eventually, his mind took ill, 
and he, too, passed away.

06:10.510 --> 06:15.800
That is the truth of the 
king's birth as I know it.

06:16.200 --> 06:17.150
Then...

06:17.600 --> 06:22.750
His Majesty is a human's child, 
but he really is royalty, too.

06:23.740 --> 06:26.400
And you've kept that huge secret all alone.

06:28.120 --> 06:29.150
Thank you.

06:29.540 --> 06:33.820
I promise that I'll tell him 
what you entrusted to me.

06:42.390 --> 06:43.390
Sariphi.

06:44.300 --> 06:47.680
If you're gonna tell the king, 
we'd better go join him quick.

06:47.920 --> 06:48.730
Right.

06:49.140 --> 06:50.840
Please wait.

06:51.170 --> 06:56.550
There is one other truth 
I must impart to you.

06:57.060 --> 06:59.110
You confound me.

06:59.110 --> 07:02.310
To think that you would return 
for your own execution.

07:02.640 --> 07:07.780
You are rebels, no longer 
even meriting a trial.

07:07.780 --> 07:09.020
Thus,

07:09.510 --> 07:12.250
I shall carry out your 
sentence here and now.

07:14.240 --> 07:15.620
Another one?

07:16.040 --> 07:18.400
To save the king.

07:18.400 --> 07:25.280
To save the tiny child whose 
destiny I set awry that day.

07:39.920 --> 07:42.090
It looks like his spell of undeath broke.

07:42.860 --> 07:48.320
Since he did his duty and passed on his 
secret, he can finally rest in peace.

07:51.210 --> 07:52.490
<i>Mr. Archpriest,</i>

07:53.310 --> 07:57.210
<i>your legacy is safe with me.</i>

07:59.540 --> 08:00.200
Sariphi.

08:00.900 --> 08:01.670
Right.

08:02.900 --> 08:05.630
<i>Wait for me, Leo. I'll be there soon.</i>

08:08.550 --> 08:09.960
What is the matter?

08:09.960 --> 08:12.220
<i>His spell is broken?</i>

08:12.220 --> 08:13.680
<i>Who could have...</i>

08:15.000 --> 08:16.020
<i>Don't tell me...</i>

08:17.860 --> 08:18.980
Chancellor,

08:19.720 --> 08:23.670
it appears that we have fallen for a feint.

08:23.670 --> 08:27.380
That human girl has snuck into the palace,

08:27.380 --> 08:30.480
likely escorted by the captain of her guard.

08:31.180 --> 08:34.110
Gather a force, and search 
every nook and cranny.

08:34.550 --> 08:35.940
Understood.

08:36.480 --> 08:38.790
I shall see to it at once.

08:39.360 --> 08:40.250
Abi!

08:42.400 --> 08:43.870
Sariphi!

08:52.270 --> 08:53.080
Sire!

08:55.020 --> 08:57.740
I would advise against overexerting yourself.

08:57.740 --> 09:02.610
You must be in far greater pain 
than the captain of your guard.

09:02.610 --> 09:06.600
Humans are truly tragic creatures.

09:06.940 --> 09:07.940
Sire...

09:07.940 --> 09:12.400
And yet, to have broken my restraints, 
even for a moment,

09:12.400 --> 09:15.400
shows how deeply you care for that girl.

09:15.700 --> 09:23.120
In deference to your love, I shall send 
you both to your graves together.

09:24.600 --> 09:26.920
A lovely view, is it not?

09:26.920 --> 09:32.250
How does it feel to look out from there 
on what was once your kingdom,

09:32.250 --> 09:34.210
human king?

09:40.500 --> 09:44.070
Oh, you needn't worry.

09:44.070 --> 09:48.730
I shall take it upon myself to restore 
this kingdom to its proper form.

09:49.150 --> 09:54.140
A nation in which species are sorted 
into a definite class system.

09:54.470 --> 09:59.030
To conceal your hideous blood, 
you mixed the wheat with the chaff.

09:59.030 --> 10:03.760
I will remake this realm 
into one of order and beauty.

10:04.620 --> 10:10.390
Wheat with wheat, chaff with chaff, 
and a king with royal blood.

10:10.390 --> 10:13.330
That is how a kingdom ought to be!

10:13.330 --> 10:14.300
No!

10:15.050 --> 10:21.260
I didn't strive for a land in which 
different species merely live together,

10:22.010 --> 10:25.550
but one in which everyone 
can live as themselves.

10:26.140 --> 10:28.690
No one can choose their birth.

10:28.690 --> 10:36.110
Some have long tails, 
others horns, hooves, or scales.

10:36.520 --> 10:41.600
But whatever their species, everyone should 
be able to take pride in themselves

10:41.600 --> 10:44.810
and live without anyone 
trampling on that pride.

10:45.280 --> 10:49.280
A nation must be a place 
where that is possible!

10:49.950 --> 10:54.260
Perhaps, as you say, I have no right to rule.

10:54.260 --> 10:58.480
But I have a duty to stop you!

10:58.480 --> 11:00.420
Until I've done that,

11:00.420 --> 11:03.170
I am still the king of this realm!

11:04.490 --> 11:06.550
A king's duty?

11:06.550 --> 11:09.190
You have no such thing.

11:09.720 --> 11:11.620
You have only...

11:12.500 --> 11:13.690
Set,

11:14.260 --> 11:18.660
the truth is that you have 
royal blood in your veins.

11:19.350 --> 11:24.610
Look. By all rights, you should 
be standing at the king's side.

11:24.610 --> 11:30.450
You should have been welcomed and 
acclaimed by all as our next king.

11:31.600 --> 11:35.770
I'm sorry that I was only able to 
give birth to you in this form.

11:36.330 --> 11:40.260
That I wasn't able to give you 
the appearance of royalty.

11:40.790 --> 11:44.310
<i>Mother and I are always 
in a corner of the palace.</i>

11:44.750 --> 11:47.450
<i>Because I don't look like the king,</i>

11:47.450 --> 11:50.630
<i>no one looks at us or pays us any attention.</i>

11:51.750 --> 11:54.610
<i>If I looked like he does, then...</i>

11:55.070 --> 11:56.510
You have only...

11:56.830 --> 12:01.400
your just deserts for deceiving us 
and continuing to play at kingship!

12:03.150 --> 12:05.170
When I slay you with my own hands,

12:05.170 --> 12:08.590
I will be able to take pride 
in myself for the first time.

12:11.330 --> 12:12.800
<i>Sariphi...</i>

12:18.170 --> 12:21.960
There are more soldiers around. 
We must be getting close to the king.

12:21.960 --> 12:23.250
Are you all right, Lante?

12:23.250 --> 12:24.960
This is a piece of cake.

12:24.960 --> 12:26.930
Wait, a dead end?

12:28.940 --> 12:31.440
That's as far as you go, wench.

12:32.550 --> 12:33.530
Sariphi—

12:33.530 --> 12:35.480
Stop it, damn you! Let go!

12:36.280 --> 12:38.470
Why do I feel so weak?

12:38.900 --> 12:42.440
You didn't notice? I laid wards in advance.

12:42.950 --> 12:46.780
I arranged things so that 
you would flee this way.

12:46.780 --> 12:50.750
So that's why I feel my power draining away.

12:51.670 --> 12:53.750
I'm disappointed in you, Chancellor.

12:54.230 --> 12:57.190
I never liked you,

12:57.190 --> 13:00.920
but I thought your loyalty to the 
king was the real deal, at least.

13:01.310 --> 13:05.770
In the end, though, you're just 
another stupid supremacist!

13:06.980 --> 13:07.910
Take him away.

13:07.910 --> 13:08.500
Yes, sir.

13:09.580 --> 13:10.420
Sariphi!

13:10.420 --> 13:12.670
Lante! Don't worry about me!

13:15.880 --> 13:18.480
You seem awfully confident.

13:19.080 --> 13:21.310
What have you come back here to do?

13:21.820 --> 13:23.650
We discovered His Majesty's origins and—

13:23.650 --> 13:25.190
That's of no consequence now.

13:25.190 --> 13:26.760
Yes, it is!

13:26.760 --> 13:31.020
You must know what's going 
on outside this palace.

13:31.360 --> 13:33.540
That's why His Majesty came back.

13:33.540 --> 13:36.710
And where he goes, I go.

13:37.320 --> 13:41.440
I've made up my mind 
to stay with him forever.

13:42.880 --> 13:45.190
I thought as much.

13:45.190 --> 13:51.170
The king taking a human form 
doesn't trouble <i>you</i> in the least.

13:51.780 --> 13:55.410
Tell me one thing: 
When did you learn of this?

13:56.200 --> 13:58.880
Have you... known all along?

14:00.050 --> 14:00.720
Yes.

14:01.620 --> 14:05.150
Ever since my first night 
of revelation in the palace,

14:05.150 --> 14:07.520
when I was supposed to be sacrificed.

14:09.160 --> 14:10.250
I see.

14:10.840 --> 14:16.110
While I, on the other hand, was fooled 
by him from the very beginning.

14:16.830 --> 14:17.980
That's not—

14:18.480 --> 14:20.620
Answer me one final question.

14:20.620 --> 14:23.180
I won't tolerate evasion or deceit.

14:23.180 --> 14:25.760
At the slightest sign of a lie, I'll kill you.

14:26.920 --> 14:31.720
If he had no human blood like yours,

14:32.460 --> 14:35.460
if he were purely a beast man,

14:36.130 --> 14:39.430
would you still have 
loved him from the first?

14:40.050 --> 14:41.470
Well...

14:42.910 --> 14:44.100
I don't know.

14:49.110 --> 14:50.530
A waste of effort.

14:50.530 --> 14:53.330
Straining too hard will 
only tear your limbs off.

14:53.700 --> 14:57.090
Humans are such frail creatures.

14:57.090 --> 15:02.290
Struggle all you wish. It will 
only make you more pathetic.

15:02.740 --> 15:05.170
<i>Say whatever you like.</i>

15:05.170 --> 15:09.760
<i>I may be in human form now, 
but I'm still the king of beasts!</i>

15:11.060 --> 15:16.360
<i>I'll never give in to someone who fails 
to protect this realm and its people!</i>

15:17.410 --> 15:18.720
Please stop.

15:19.210 --> 15:21.190
To continue would be meaningless.

15:21.190 --> 15:22.690
Anubis...

15:22.690 --> 15:23.910
Sariphi!

15:23.910 --> 15:26.870
As expected of our chancellor, 
you work quickly.

15:27.340 --> 15:29.040
However...

15:29.040 --> 15:32.330
I haven't killed her. 
She is merely unconscious.

15:32.730 --> 15:36.410
I see. Then the cast is all assembled.

15:36.410 --> 15:39.950
Let us begin with the girl's execution.

15:39.950 --> 15:42.530
By your hand, Chancellor.

15:44.190 --> 15:45.260
Mine?

15:45.610 --> 15:49.430
This girl conspired with the 
false king to deceive you.

15:49.430 --> 15:52.470
They trampled on your pride and dignity.

15:52.810 --> 15:55.690
You have every right.

15:59.040 --> 16:00.320
You don't know?

16:00.320 --> 16:01.970
What do you mean by that?!

16:02.420 --> 16:05.820
Can't you love a pure-blooded beast, then?

16:05.820 --> 16:07.910
So that's all you amount to.

16:07.910 --> 16:11.940
You can only <i>truly</i> love 
other humans like yourself!

16:11.940 --> 16:15.320
That's not it. I don't really 
understand what you're asking.

16:16.090 --> 16:18.410
I mean, His Majesty is both.

16:19.880 --> 16:26.630
He has both beast and human blood, 
and he agonized over that a lot.

16:26.630 --> 16:28.340
And now he's kinder than anyone else.

16:28.740 --> 16:30.300
That's His Majesty.

16:32.280 --> 16:34.910
That's the king I love.

16:35.440 --> 16:37.840
My Leonhart.

16:40.370 --> 16:41.510
What?!

16:41.510 --> 16:43.140
Y-You dare?!

16:53.470 --> 16:54.350
Leo!

16:55.480 --> 16:56.610
Anubis!

16:56.610 --> 17:02.590
Not content with betraying me, 
you would return to your former king?!

17:02.590 --> 17:04.700
Return? Betray?

17:05.330 --> 17:07.030
Whatever do you mean?

17:07.500 --> 17:10.740
Have I ever, even once, called you king?

17:11.140 --> 17:13.460
I serve the true king.

17:13.910 --> 17:18.440
Though he may bizarrely have 
assumed human form, my king

17:18.440 --> 17:20.380
is this man and no other!

17:21.850 --> 17:23.850
Curse you!

17:27.000 --> 17:27.560
Abi!

17:31.150 --> 17:33.110
Now I'll finish you—

17:34.880 --> 17:36.160
Wh-What?!

17:36.390 --> 17:41.780
We folk of the sea shall not sit 
by in our lord's hour of need.

17:41.780 --> 17:48.040
We have come to restore this realm 
and its people to our king.

17:48.430 --> 17:52.390
The full might of the 
Istanese navy has arrived!

17:52.390 --> 17:55.700
Grandpa Galois! And Joz, too!

17:55.980 --> 17:57.310
Forward!

18:01.660 --> 18:03.440
Hey, state of emergency!

18:03.440 --> 18:05.570
Lord Set called up the whole guard!

18:05.860 --> 18:07.150
What happened?

18:07.150 --> 18:08.900
What do we do with him?

18:08.900 --> 18:10.140
Just get a move on!

18:16.180 --> 18:18.760
I don't know what's going on, 
but this looks like my chance.

18:18.760 --> 18:20.860
P-Please stay still!

18:20.860 --> 18:21.620
Huh?

18:22.090 --> 18:23.280
Princess Amit?

18:24.730 --> 18:26.360
And the blobs, too.

18:26.360 --> 18:29.590
What're you doing here? 
We told you to wait outside.

18:29.590 --> 18:34.210
W-We're terribly sorry, but we 
simply couldn't stand idly by.

18:34.720 --> 18:39.260
And when we reached the palace, we met 
gentlemen from the Istanese navy, so...

18:39.260 --> 18:40.610
The Istanese navy?!

18:40.610 --> 18:42.470
So that's what this fuss is about!

18:42.470 --> 18:44.140
All right, then! What're we—

18:44.140 --> 18:46.180
Please wait a moment!

18:46.470 --> 18:50.400
M-Might you help us find 
what we're searching for?

18:50.730 --> 18:54.520
If we succeed, we may be able 
to rescue the king from his plight.

19:01.200 --> 19:03.710
Don't push yerself too hard, boss.

19:03.710 --> 19:06.360
Ya complained about yer hip 
actin' up just yesterday.

19:06.360 --> 19:08.410
You needn't worry.

19:11.930 --> 19:17.080
Old I may be, but I, Galois, 
was once known as the Sea God.

19:17.080 --> 19:19.960
No fledgling will get the better of me yet!

19:21.420 --> 19:24.060
Neither hate the beasts nor fear them.

19:25.010 --> 19:27.390
Take the refugees under 
your protection at once!

19:27.740 --> 19:30.340
The king of Maskviana commands it!

19:30.810 --> 19:33.930
Running to filthy humans for succor,

19:33.930 --> 19:35.820
you lesser species?!

19:38.410 --> 19:39.930
Get them out of here, fast!

19:39.930 --> 19:40.540
Come on!

19:40.540 --> 19:41.350
This way!

19:41.850 --> 19:42.660
Tha...

19:44.630 --> 19:46.150
Thank you!

19:50.700 --> 19:53.080
Damn you, human!

19:54.570 --> 19:56.950
Do your worst, monster.

19:57.250 --> 19:58.430
What's taking you so long?!

19:58.790 --> 20:01.560
Why are you struggling 
to best these sea scum?!

20:01.560 --> 20:03.520
Lord Set, it's an emergency!

20:03.520 --> 20:06.040
The Kingdom of Sarbul has 
sent an urgent message!

20:07.170 --> 20:08.770
Sarbul?

20:08.770 --> 20:10.550
That's Tetra's home.

20:10.550 --> 20:14.450
My people, all the lands of Ozmargo

20:14.450 --> 20:17.180
are now faced with a choice 
of grave importance.

20:17.600 --> 20:23.420
We would be first-class subjects 
under the new king's system.

20:23.420 --> 20:27.650
Accepting that status may pave 
the way for our future prosperity.

20:28.140 --> 20:29.400
I, however,

20:29.900 --> 20:31.620
reject it!

20:32.820 --> 20:36.700
Some may view my choice as folly.

20:36.940 --> 20:39.910
But for the youth on whom the future rests—

20:40.260 --> 20:42.400
for the children who will inhabit that future—

20:42.400 --> 20:46.670
we must not leave a world where one's 
species determines one's standing!

20:47.120 --> 20:50.740
Our Sarbul stands behind the king of Ozmargo,

20:50.740 --> 20:54.750
who has championed the equality 
of species since his accession!

20:56.550 --> 20:57.910
<i>Sariphi,</i>

20:58.390 --> 21:01.020
<i>we're on your side!</i>

21:01.020 --> 21:04.750
As has Lord Braun Breuse, 
overlord of Maasya,

21:04.750 --> 21:07.700
King Ur I of Bolstobas, and others.

21:07.700 --> 21:10.750
If the king of Ozmargo does 
not resume his reign,

21:10.750 --> 21:14.200
they are all prepared 
to do battle for his cause!

21:17.370 --> 21:18.460
Here it is!

21:18.710 --> 21:23.560
A fixed magical array. This is what is 
clearing the miasma from the skies.

21:23.560 --> 21:25.200
Good job figuring that out.

21:25.200 --> 21:28.310
Given how long the spell 
has remained in effect,

21:28.310 --> 21:30.940
I felt certain that there 
was some trick to it.

21:30.940 --> 21:33.780
So if we destroy this, then—

21:34.560 --> 21:36.550
Ow! That stings!

21:36.550 --> 21:38.490
What the hell?! More wards?!

21:38.910 --> 21:40.970
This is a blood pact.

21:40.970 --> 21:45.240
The caster's blood serves as a 
medium to control the spell.

21:45.590 --> 21:48.650
Unless we have enough blood 
to overwrite the pact...

21:49.610 --> 21:50.910
Princess Amit?!

21:51.860 --> 21:53.380
What is the meaning of this?

21:53.670 --> 22:00.180
I can understand the sea scum revolting, 
but I made those lands first-class subjects!

22:00.180 --> 22:01.840
Curse their moral posturing!

22:01.840 --> 22:03.330
They aren't just posturing!

22:03.600 --> 22:04.790
Sariphi...

22:05.470 --> 22:10.290
I know that some people 
enjoy keeping others down,

22:11.090 --> 22:15.660
but no one is born deserving 
to be treated as lesser.

22:16.130 --> 22:20.100
His Majesty worked hard to 
stop that from happening!

22:20.530 --> 22:23.580
The people who are willing 
to fight alongside him now

22:23.580 --> 22:26.580
are the ones who really understood that.

22:28.270 --> 22:31.350
If you really want to be king,

22:31.350 --> 22:35.950
listen to everyone's voices, and look 
at the people who live in this realm.

22:35.950 --> 22:40.920
Why would anyone look to you when 
you don't even try to see them?!

22:43.020 --> 22:44.220
Silence.

22:44.940 --> 22:45.670
Sari—

22:45.670 --> 22:48.280
Be silent!

22:54.520 --> 22:55.650
<i>Sariphi.</i>

22:56.230 --> 22:57.170
<i>You,</i>

22:57.670 --> 22:58.400
<i>all of you,</i>

22:59.520 --> 23:02.480
<i>gave strength to a weakling like me!</i>

23:03.040 --> 23:04.150
<i>So...</i>

23:04.730 --> 23:06.400
<i>So I will...</i>

23:10.770 --> 23:11.530
What?!

23:18.280 --> 23:21.690
<i>...repay your devotion!</i>

23:25.990 --> 23:31.670
Hey, Leo, do you remember when 
I first came here as a sacrifice?

23:32.360 --> 23:35.340
You were the strongest, 
kindest person there was.

23:35.720 --> 23:39.650
I hope that your feelings reach 
everyone in your kingdom.

23:37.060 --> 23:40.050
Next Episode

23:37.060 --> 23:40.050
A Queen and the Future of the Kingdom
